rs, pressure sensors, temperature sensors, and level sensors. It also provides pneumatic components; safety light curtains, laser scanners, interlock switches, and controller; microscopes/laser microscopes; optical comparator; coordinate measuring machine, 3D scanner, and 3D optical profilometers; programmable logic controller, micro PLC /small PLC, HMI, servo motors/servo systems, and other control products; and marking/coding, barcode reader, mobile computers/handheld computers, data acquisition, static control, additive manufacturing, and RPA/desktop automation software products. The company's products are used in automotive, metals, semiconductors/LCDs, electronic devices, plastics, films/sheets, food/pharmaceutical, medical technology, and logistics applications. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan.","fullTimeEmployees":12784,"city":"Osaka","country":"Japan","website":"https://www.keyence.com","industry":"Scientific & Technical Instruments","sector":"Technology"},"news":[{"title":"AI Elite Lose $18 Billion as Chip Stock Rout Spreads to Asia","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/ai-elite-lose-18-billion-072248780.html","publisher":"Bloomberg","date":"2026-11-06"},{"title":"Keyence (TSE:6861) Stock Price Meets A Q2 Earnings Valuation Reckoning","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/keyence-tse-6861-stock-price-191123775.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-10-30"},{"title":"Keyence (TSE:6861) Could Be 70% Overvalued As Valuation Questions Build","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/keyence-tse-6861-could-70-081402009.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-10-10"},{"title":"Keyence (TSE:6861) Stock Looks Overvalued On Current Earnings","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/keyence-tse-6861-stock-looks-211659991.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-10-09"},{"title":"Are Industrial Products Stocks Lagging  Keyence (KYCCF